Program2 : Write a program to take input of radius of a circle then calculate area and perimeter at the end print both the result.

SourceCode :
#include <stdio.h>

int main()
{
    float r, area, perimeter;
    printf("Enter radius: ");
    scanf("%f", &r);

    area = 3.14 * r * r;
    perimeter = 2 * 3.14 * r;

    printf("Area = %.2f\n", area);
    printf("Perimeter = %.2f", perimeter);

    return 0;
}

Output :
Enter radius: 5
Area = 78.50
Perimeter = 31.40

